<title>Podgląd — wiersz Powłoka (po poprawce)</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0f1117; --bg-card:#1e2333; --bg-input:#141720;
    --border:#2a3048; --border-hi:#3d4a70;
    --text-primary:#e8ecf5; --text-secondary:#7b88aa; --text-muted:#4a536b;
    --text-value:#c8d4f0; --accent-hrs:#e8a020; --accent-cr:#3b8ef5;
    --rowline:rgba(42,48,72,.5);
    --mono:ui-monospace,"Cascadia Code","Consolas",monospace;
    --sans:"Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-primary);font-family:var(--sans);
    padding:28px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:18px}

  .note{max-width:600px;width:100%;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--text-secondary)}
  .note b{color:var(--text-primary)}
  .note .chip{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-family:var(--mono);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:5px;
    border:1px solid var(--accent-hrs);color:var(--accent-hrs);background:rgba(232,160,32,.12);vertical-align:1px}

  .panel{width:600px;max-width:100%;background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
  .phead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-hrs);flex:0 0 auto}
  .ptitle{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-primary)}
  .psub{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--text-secondary)}

  .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rowline)}
  .row.hl{background:rgba(232,160,32,.05)}
  .label{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:12px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;white-space:nowrap}
  .toggles{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:3px;justify-content:flex-end;flex:0 1 auto}
  .toggles.coat{gap:2px}
  .btn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;font-weight:500;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:4px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg-input);color:var(--text-secondary);white-space:nowrap}
  .toggles.coat .btn{font-size:9px;padding:3px 5px}
  .btn.on{background:rgba(59,142,245,.15);border-color:var(--accent-cr);color:var(--accent-cr);font-weight:700}
  .val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-value);
    text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .val.neg{color:#f5475a}
  .unit{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);white-space:nowrap}
  .tag{margin-left:8px;font-size:9px;font-family:var(--mono);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px;
    border:1px solid var(--accent-hrs);color:var(--accent-hrs);background:rgba(232,160,32,.12);flex:0 0 auto}

  .sum{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px}
  .sum-label{flex:1;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-hrs)}
  .sum-val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent-hrs);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .sum-unit{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--accent-hrs);margin-left:4px;opacity:.85}
</style>

<div class="note">
  <b>Podgląd wiersza „Powłoka" po poprawce.</b> Statyczny, wierny mock panelu HUTA DOPŁATY w ciemnym
  motywie aplikacji (te same kolory i rozmiary co produkcja). Wiersz oznaczony
  <span class="chip">poprawione</span> pokazuje docelowy układ: przyciski w jednej linii, a cena
  <b>28&nbsp;€/t</b> po prawej stronie — tak jak „0&nbsp;€/t" w pozostałych wierszach, zamiast spadać pod spód.
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <div class="phead">
    <span class="dot"></span>
    <span class="ptitle">Huta dopłaty</span>
    <span class="psub">mill surcharges</span>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Okres ważności PGL</span>
    <span class="val">0</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Grubość / szerokość</span>
    <span class="val">22</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Gatunek</span>
    <span class="val">2</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Tolerancja grubości</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn on">Normalna</span><span class="btn">Specjalna</span>
      <span class="btn">1/2 EN</span><span class="btn">1/3 EN</span><span class="btn">1/4 EN</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">0</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Certyfikat</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn">2.2</span><span class="btn on">3.1</span><span class="btn">3.2</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">5</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>

  <!-- POPRAWIONY wiersz powłoki: jedna linia, cena po prawej -->
  <div class="row hl">
    <span class="label">Powłoka</span>
    <div class="toggles coat">
      <span class="btn">Z100</span><span class="btn">Z140</span><span class="btn">Z200</span>
      <span class="btn">Z225</span><span class="btn on">Z275</span><span class="btn">Z350</span>
      <span class="btn">Z450</span><span class="btn">Z600</span><span class="btn">Z725</span><span class="btn">Z800</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">28</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
    <span class="tag">poprawione</span>
  </div>

  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Zabezpieczenie</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn">O</span><span class="btn">EO</span><span class="btn">S</span><span class="btn on">CE</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">0</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Opakowanie</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn">Bez papieru</span><span class="btn on">Papier/plastik</span>
      <span class="btn">Transport morski</span><span class="btn">Papier/plastik (CE)</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">5</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Powierzchnia (HDG)</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn on">MA</span><span class="btn">MB</span><span class="btn">MC</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">0</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Wykończenie pow.</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn on">Standard</span><span class="btn">Błyszczące</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val">0</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Zgrzew</span>
    <div class="toggles">
      <span class="btn on">Dozwolony</span><span class="btn">Niedozwolony</span><span class="btn">Inne</span>
    </div>
    <span class="val neg">-3</span><span class="unit">€/t</span>
  </div>

  <div class="sum">
    <span class="sum-label">Suma huta</span>
    <span class="sum-val">59.00</span><span class="sum-unit">€/t</span>
  </div>
</div>
